@MovieApp.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5176

GET {{MovieApp.WebApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### GET Seat Availability
GET {{MovieApp.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/screenings/1/seats
Accept: application/json

### POST Book a Seat
POST {{MovieApp.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/screenings/1/book
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "seats": [
    { "row": 1, "column": 1 }
  ]
}

